# Project Context

## Product

Regpoint Vendor Admin — sales registry, price lists, activation codes, support inbox.

## Trust Model (offline-first)

1. Box activates locally with signed code + `LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEY`.
2. Vendor-admin holds `LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY`; never ships to client image.
3. Online verify-code is optional (3s timeout); failure must not block activate.
4. Per-instance `X-Instance-Token` issued at instance create; display once.

## Monorepo Target

```
packages/license-signing
apps/api          # Express /api/v1
apps/web          # React SPA
```

## Design Tokens

- Primary `#243954`, accent `#e1eff2`, sidebar 240px, radius 8px
- Fonts: Ubuntu (headings), Times New Roman / system (body)

